# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible: the service Dockerfiles COPY from the
# repo root, so exclude build output, dependencies, and VCS/local cruft that the image rebuilds
# from source anyway. (The Python vertical has its own service-dir .dockerignore; this covers
# the repo-root-context builds used by the Go/Rust/TS/Java images.)
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/coverage
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.log
.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
